{"pageid":2454,"title":"Obsidian Skull","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Obsidian Skull</span>","revid":20512,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Obsidian Skull</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Obsidian_Skull.png/revision/latest?cb=20240315204241\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Obsidian Skull\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Obsidian_Skull.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240315204241\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Obsidian_Skull.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240315204241 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Obsidian_Skull.png/revision/latest?cb=20240315204241 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Obsidian Skull\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Obsidian_Skull.png\" data-image-name=\"Obsidian Skull.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Shop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$200,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Grants the ability to walk on lava and a 45 second heat resistance</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.52.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"Forged from the depths of below, this skull holds the darkest of sins, and grants the ability to walk on lava\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Obsidian Skull</b> is available for purchase at the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Shop</a> situated within the depths of the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a>, priced at <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$200,000</span>.\nWhen equipped, it grants the player the ability to walk on lava with a 45 second heat resistance. It also grants the ability to drive a car on lava, though this is substantially less useful as the car will immediately sink if the player exits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>When equipped, the <b>Obsidian Skull</b> shows as a belt around the players waist with a <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">skull</a> serving as its buckle. The bands of the belt is metal, along with fire esc ornaments positioned on either side of the skull.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>While wearing the Obsidian Skull, the player will hear an evil laugh while loading their save.</li>\n<li>The Obsidian Skull is the fourth most expensive item, after Flamethrower, <a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Warhead\" title=\"Nuclear Warhead\">Nuclear Warhead</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Glass_Ducky\" title=\"Glass Ducky\">Glass ducky</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902114550\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 67/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019482/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.748